  "title": "Greek Tomato Feta Fritters (Domatokeftethes)",
  "description": "Chef John's take on domatokeftethes, or Greek tomato feta fritters, provides the ultimate fried appetizer for summertime.",
  "authors": [
    "John Mitzewich"
  ],
  "date_published": "2022-07-19T09:00:00-04:00",
